The best solution I found is feasible with a score of 2928.1. Two independent GA runs returned the same routes, and the evaluator reports no late arrivals, no excess load, no depot violations, and no unserved customers.

Method: I ran the four classic methods (heuristic, tabu, ACO, GA). Heuristic, tabu and ACO each left customers unserved or violated time windows, so the GA solution is the one I report. It uses 24 of the 25 available vehicles, and its total truncated distance is 2928.1. Since the score equals the total distance when all customers are served on time and within capacity, the score is 2928.1. I did not run a proof of optimality, so this is the best feasible solution found, not a certified optimum.

